<title>USA: Woodward Governor, Catalytica in venture.</title>
<headline>Woodward Governor, Catalytica in venture.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woodward Governor Co and Catalytica Combustion Systems Inc, a unit of Catalytica Inc, said Tuesday they formed a 50/50 joint venture company.</p>
<p>The new company, GENXON Power Systems, will serve the gas turbine retrofit market for installed, out-of-warranty engines.</p>
<p>It will provide gas turbine fleet asset planning for both the power generation and mechanical drive markets.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
